{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>Which is upon the tabernacle.</b> For it is inside the court." "<b>And upon the altar.</b> For it is outside the tabernacle." "And the meaning of <b>around.</b> is that there is no place lacking there, like a breach where there is no screen." "<b>For all its service.</b> I will yet explain it."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:08.461026398Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}